  "label": "Alzheimer's patient is mapped onto Samuel L. Jackson",
  "description": "The text 'alzheimer's patient:' explicitly labels the visual entity Samuel_L_Jackson as the subject of the scene. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual label 'alzheimer's patient' is projected onto the visual representation of Samuel L. Jackson, who is portrayed in the image as reacting to the nurse's announcement. The mapping is direct and explicit through the text positioning.",
